{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ad13e1933acb53f99902f9581e74edf93af83971c15c580feb66fd9b316cfd20", "ja": "（今日は美奈子と瑞希のPV撮影だ。\n野外ロケだけど、美奈子の様子はどうかな？）", "zh": "（今天是美奈子和瑞希的PV拍摄。\n虽然是在户外取景，但美奈子的状态怎么样呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "9a068970f958b19e83ce27ef0057b236bd206cbdd45a6b230049676a817dd4c6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです♪\nもしかして、様子を見に来てくれたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了♪\n你是特意过来看看情况的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c6ee228ac2b76fa16dd478111b3d8d08902fda544530f6439162bd6ae1236b6b", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。調子はどうだ？", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "9e5a82b4b3242670a852e009a82f9c675b11c5109711afb954a328f678a54c52", "ja": "まかせてください！　今日は瑞希ちゃんとの\nおうちデート特訓の成果、見せちゃいますから！", "zh": "交给我吧！今天就让你看看我和瑞希酱进行居家约会特训的成果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1004_p", "source_sha256": "704923c6fe40ffda2585332d5b91226be2f805ff17d1c27ba2a3894615f06aad", "ja": "おうちデート特訓？　ああ、そういえば。\nそんな感じの事をやってたんだっけ……。", "zh": "居家约会特训？啊，这么一说，确实有这么回事。我们之前做过类似的事情来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "156cbf544a82a2e574fd4eb82fabdc77d67a3dee4adb419eee888b84116975b7", "ja": "はい！　彼氏彼女のことをしっかり予習して\nきたので、雰囲気はバッチリ出せると思いますよ！", "zh": "是的！我已经认真预习过情侣之间的相处方式了，所以我觉得一定能把气氛营造得很到位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1006_p", "source_sha256": "60efd295064634bffba00d5c56f62567fc61f46932b20428efeb9a46e0ca69a1", "ja": "おっ、かなり自信ありそうだな。\n仕上がりが楽しみだ……は、は、っくしゅん！！", "zh": "哦，看起来相当有自信嘛。\n真期待成品啊……哈、哈、哈啾！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "93ad96253b34958f89fa160136f51526602d7fda5c86f549307bf8d470c7e8f2", "ja": "{$P$}さん！？\n大丈夫ですか？　急にそんな、大きなくしゃみ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！？\n您没事吧？突然打了这么大一个喷嚏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1008_p", "source_sha256": "777e9ce4d5f97b51494208b5b9fc8f684e00678d9c52f31d28e2c3b5479a99ea", "ja": "ううっ。ここ、思ったより冷えるなあ。\n美奈子のほうこそ、大丈夫か？　寒くないか？", "zh": "呜呜。这里比想象中还要冷啊。\n倒是美奈子你，没问题吗？不觉得冷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "0dbe348d301023f346903536aefe12862c7127224f453e99bc6f875b380db4a7", "ja": "もうっ、{$P$}さん！\n今は私より、自分の心配をしてください！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生！\n现在比起我，您还是多担心一下自己吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "d34a3a9fe51438636cbe6ea1c7ec216da34bd9b44193be85a69f94f375afe31a", "ja": "そうだ！　控え室から、上着取ってきましょうか？\nそれとも、あったかい飲み物の方が……？", "zh": "对了！要不要我去休息室拿件外套来？\n还是说，喝点热饮会更好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6e3e4deb7ed24dc48110a022860e1db169df09646bf9341a0905484fa016864f", "ja": "……。ん？　美奈子？", "zh": "……。嗯？美奈子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "336a4900d4407752e2c644f92c91a584d8a929bd553963c87989925741eb5ce1", "ja": "うーん……こういう、お世話のし過ぎがいけないの\nかな？　相手に迷惑に思われちゃったり……。", "zh": "嗯……像这样照顾过头，是不是反而不好呢？会不会让对方觉得困扰……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6085d07c16d4087b2274a0bd3766e1c73dda6abf1d6721ca3dcfa12b63e93d6e", "ja": "おーい？　急にぶつぶつ言ってどうした？", "zh": "喂——？突然嘀嘀咕咕的，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "2d9845d38aecd09d5cab96b154f8c0a2c0c0e03519effa95966f5fa96108aa12", "ja": "あっ、すみません！　えっと……最近読んだ雑誌に、\n恋人達の別れる原因、みたいなのが載ってて。", "zh": "啊，对不起！那个……我最近看的一本杂志上，刊登了类似“情侣分手的原因”这样的内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "cbd556f87f52f99a0671a7be139be1dfa7234b308a9aa2e83b869a32fee880a2", "ja": "尽くし過ぎて振られちゃう子とか、いるんですよね。\n重い～、とか、ウザい～、みたいな。", "zh": "好像也有因为付出太多而被甩的女孩子呢。\n比如被觉得“太沉重了～”或者“好烦人～”之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "716d33dc8a69e9c753b858ed75afa917b7e0deab0342365d093e2b9deb433ccc", "ja": "それで……私もそういうタイプなのかも、って。", "zh": "所以……我可能也是那种类型吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c5f3b2c82b7913b37d374b01cf5c8dfe6e634e3980977e252f9704e36ced2493", "ja": "なるほど、勉強熱心なんだな。\nまあ、それは考え過ぎだと思うけど。", "zh": "原来如此，你还真是个勤奋好学的人啊。\n不过，我觉得你可能想得太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "57a660e7e92a3225c4806d2065615489303af1ad15679dc25b092fdc1aeb0975", "ja": "でも……あの。私に世話を焼かれるの、イヤじゃない\nですか？　迷惑だなって、思ったこととかは……？", "zh": "可是……那个。你不会讨厌被我照顾吧？有没有觉得……我很烦人之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_1020", "source_sha256": "9cbad6d913ed01d092f6bff4bf9c540f04340036add38466a20b2f22286d78f0", "ja": "ない！", "zh": "没有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5101ce22179447542caf438536b544b9ef5b168936d1593f95dd71e21d81bbc5", "ja": "いや、ない。全然ない。いつも助かってる。\n気配りは、美奈子のいいところだよ。", "zh": "不，没有的事。完全没有。你一直帮了我大忙呢。\n懂得体贴照顾人，可是美奈子的优点哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_2001_019min", "source_sha256": "962786f9d6870283b3d605124a59b5eb90a4ff41fb50f789b170614f69af1632", "ja": "いいところ……えへへっ♪　\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "优点……嘿嘿♪\n谢谢您，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_2002_019min", "source_sha256": "87f09596653c39ca16d40e2c62ed4eef3fd11a21b655870bf8ec8681e9753320", "ja": "なんだか、ぽかぽかしてきちゃったかも♪\nあ、ちょっと待っててくださいね！", "zh": "不知不觉间，好像暖和起来了呢♪\n啊，请稍微等我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0194_2003_019min", "source_sha256": "9c97f67b373432bb4a10609d8fe233cdb107baccdb0792a6e2aec549105251b9", "ja": "あったかいお茶と、上着とカイロと、\nそれに、毛布と肉まん！　すぐ持ってきますから！", "zh": "热茶、外套、暖宝宝，\n还有毛毯和肉包！我马上拿过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
